<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αντος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήλεια ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
			Phylarch.
			36J.
		</span></i>): irreg. gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεφάντου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					35.286
				</span></i>
			(Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>): dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Ma.</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.):—<i>elephant</i>, first mentioned by <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> as a native of Africa, <i><span class="en">
				3.114
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.191
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαντος ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.97
				</span></i>
			; of the Indian <i>elephant</i>, first in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				298a13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				610a15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.12.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only of <i>elephant's tusk, ivory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.583
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				373a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5500
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφαις</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				20a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεφαντίασις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.1423
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.331
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> a
				<i>precious stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> a kind of
				<i>cup</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damox.
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεφάντωσις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Apul.
				<u>Herb.</u>
				36
			</span></i>.</div>
